1. EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud) – Virtual Server 💻
Kya hai?
Internet par ek virtual computer (server).

Kyun use hota hai?
Website ya application chalane ke liye.

Real Example:
Jaise aapke ghar ka computer hota hai, waise hi AWS ka online computer EC2 hai.
👉 Use: Website host karna, Java/Python application chalana, Docker chalana.

2. S3 (Simple Storage Service) – Storage 📂
Kya hai?
Files store karne ki service.

Kyun use hota hai?
Images, videos, PDFs, backups, logs store karne ke liye.

Real Example:
Jaise Google Drive ya OneDrive me files rakhte ho, waise hi AWS me S3 hota hai.
👉 Use: Images, videos, documents, backups.

3. RDS (Relational Database Service) – Database 🗄️
Kya hai?
Database ko manage karne ki AWS service.

Kyun use hota hai?
User ka data save karne ke liye.

Real Example:
Agar kisi website par login karte ho, to username aur password database me save hota hai. AWS me ye kaam RDS karta hai.
👉 Use: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL Server databases.

4. VPC (Virtual Private Cloud) – Networking 🌐

Kya hai?

AWS me aapka private network.

Kyun use hota hai?

Taaki aapke servers secure rahein aur sirf allowed traffic hi aaye.

Real Example:
Jaise ghar ki boundary wall aur gate hote hain, waise hi AWS me VPC aapke resources ko protect karta hai.

👉 Use: EC2, RDS aur dusre resources ko secure network me rakhna.

5. IAM (Identity and Access Management) – Security 🔐
Kya hai?
Users aur permissions manage karne ki service.

Kyun use hota hai?
Kaun AWS me kya access kar sakta hai, ye control karne ke liye.

Real Example:
Office me sab employees ko alag-alag access milta hai. Kisi ko sirf dekhne ka, kisi ko edit karne ka. AWS me ye kaam IAM karta hai.
👉 Use: Users, Groups, Roles, Permissions.

> Simple Flow
User
  │
  ▼
EC2  → Website/Application chalti hai
  │
  ├── S3 → Images, Videos, Files store hoti hain
  │
  └── RDS → User ka data (Database) store hota hai

Sab kuch VPC ke secure network ke andar hota hai.
IAM decide karta hai ki kaun in resources ko access kar sakta hai.

> Ek line me yaad rakho:
EC2 = Online Computer (Server)
S3 = File Storage
RDS = Database
VPC = Private Network
IAM = Security & Permissions

