Amazon CloudWatch
Amazon CloudWatch AWS ki monitoring service hai jo EC2, RDS, Lambda aur anya AWS resources ke metrics, logs aur alarms ko monitor karti hai.

Prometheus
Prometheus ek open-source monitoring tool hai jo applications aur servers se metrics collect aur store karta hai.

Grafana
Grafana ek visualization tool hai jo Prometheus jaise data sources ke metrics ko dashboards aur graphs ke roop me dikhata hai.

> ELK Stack
ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash aur Kibana) ek logging solution hai jo logs ko collect, store, search aur visualize karne ke liye use hota hai.

Ek line me yaad rakho
☁️ CloudWatch = AWS Monitoring
📊 Prometheus = Metrics Collect
📈 Grafana = Dashboard & Graphs
📜 ELK Stack = Logs Management

> Yaad rakhne ki trick
Server Running
      │
      ├── CloudWatch → AWS ko monitor karta hai
      ├── Prometheus → Metrics collect karta hai
      ├── Grafana → Metrics ko graph me dikhata hai
      └── ELK → Logs ko collect aur search karta hai
> Short Formula
CloudWatch = AWS Monitoring
Prometheus = Metrics
Grafana = Dashboard
ELK = Logs

